 "headline": "“This just made me more HYPE for the VMAs!” <em>- </em><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DdxdggpPOBV/\"><em>@asantemadrigal</em></a>",
 "intro": "PARAMOUNT hired IHC TO HYPE UP THE VMAS WITH MOBILE DJ POP UPS AROUND Los Angeles LEADING UP TO THE awards.",
