   ],
   "html": "<p>Pop-up performances usually ask people to travel to one fixed venue, but The Moon Mobile turned the journey itself into the show with the final destination being music’s most iconic night. </p>\n<p>Drumming up excitement with the unexpected, in the days leading up to the VMAs, established DJs performed live from our custom moving stage that served as a traveling billboard across Los Angeles. </p>\n<p>At multiple stops, the Moon Mobile met a waiting crowd and created an unmissable sense of urgency as it drove endless social sharing about ‘what happened next’ - as it lead all the way up to the VMAs themselves.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "THE truck",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>We worked with <a href=\"https://www.galpinautosports.com/\"><strong>Galpin Auto Sports</strong></a> to pimp out a 36-ft monster limo truck and turned it into the Moon Mobile featuring live DJs sets, creators, and a hot seat for press to come along for the ride. The Moon Mobile included a fully custom blue chrome wrap, VMAs logo custom grill, and branded decals. </p>"
