   "title": "THE BUILD",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The exterior included a Moon Person hood ornament, branded mud flaps, custom flags, and speakers to keep the party rolling. The interior was decked out with vinyl decals, branded pillows, and a full DJ setup, holding up to 12 people with the windows open and music blasting for peak visibility.</p>"
