  {
   "title": "TALENT BOOKING",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>We curated a lineup of DJs to play pop-up performances throughout the city leading up to the VMAs.<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/calebcalloway/?hl=en\"><strong>Caleb Calloway</strong></a><strong> </strong>kicked it off at the VMAs Blue Carpet Kick-Off. On Friday we had DJ sets from <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/alicealice916/?hl=en\"><strong>Alice Longyu Gao</strong></a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/tarayummyy/?hl=en\"><strong>Tara Yummy</strong></a>, and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/djkaraba/?hl=en\"><strong>Karaba</strong></a>. On Saturday we had DJ sets from <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nikki__nair/?hl=en\"><strong>Nikki Nair</strong>,</a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nicolasvans/?hl=en\"><strong>Nic Vans</strong></a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/bludetiger/?hl=en\"><strong>Blu DeTiger</strong></a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/injiverse/?hl=en\"><strong>Inji</strong></a>, and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/jersey.cr/?hl=en\"><strong>Jersey</strong></a>.</p>"
    },
