  {
   "title": "THE ROUTE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>The Moon Mobile debuted at the VMAs Blue Carpet Kick-Off to get the party started. Our Friday route drove through USC Village, Koreatown, Silverlake, and Echo Park before parking in front of Los Globos. Saturday we drove through Hollywood and stopped at Barney’s Beanery in West Hollywood. We then drove towards Burbank to stop at the Los Feliz Night Market. On our final day, we rolled through Mid Wilshire through Melrose-Fairfax District to the Peacock Theatre for the VMAs.</p>"
    },
